lines += [f"| Theo takes milestone reviews | Player level, XP, requests and gold match the no-exam run. Scholar **{theo['final']['classLevel']} → {tr['final']['classLevel']}**; Data Analyst **{theo['final']['professionLevel']} → {tr['final']['professionLevel']}**. INT **{theo['final']['stats']['INT']} → {tr['final']['stats']['INT']}** is a game-stat effect, not an observed cognitive gain. |",f"| Elena keeps Baker instead of changing career | No-change Baker ends at **{er['final']['professionLevel']}**. The change run retains Baker **{next(x['level'] for x in el['professionHistory'] if x['name']=='Baker')}** and adds Graphic Designer **{el['final']['professionLevel']}**, with two learned career utilities. |",f"| Maya skips Adventures | All five checkpoints have identical player XP, stats, class, profession and vocation progression. Wallet: **{n(ma['final']['gold'])}** with Adventures versus **{n(mr['final']['gold'])}** without; the shopping policy spends more than its added Adventure income in this particular route. Required hybrid quests were not selected. |",'', '![Four examples of separate progression tracks](journeys.png)','', '## What this says about the app','', 'The strongest fit is a person who enjoys persistent RPG progress and deliberately chooses a manageable set of real-world work. Career-focused support play is viable: Nadia’s player/profession progression and companion-supported battles continue while Sentinel remains 1. Helen’s smaller outcome is still a usable low-intensity routine; an A-rank badge is not required for her stated success.','', 'The weakest part is explaining what a large number means. Player, class, profession, vocation, skill-wallet and assessed-performance tracks can diverge sharply. A high vocation level does not pass a class exam; a high advanced class does not necessarily satisfy a basic-class prestige prerequisite; cross-category vocation work can credit a different selected profession. Those distinctions need direct labels and actionable next steps.','', 'Reward yield also depends heavily on whether a schedule crosses calendar thresholds. The annual XP-per-assigned-hour range is about **'+f"{min(r['final']['xp']*60/r['minutes'] for r in primary):.0f}–{max(r['final']['xp']*60/r['minutes'] for r in primary):.0f}"+'**. The personas differ in task rank, focus and acceptance policy, so this is a diagnostic spread, not a controlled value comparison between occupations. It warrants a matched effort/schedule balance study.','', 'The profession catalogue is broad enough for this cohort, but the detailed role assignments were authored for the study. The app supplies category guidance rather than all 32 individualized professional curricula; these outcomes assume the actor has chosen useful work. Later depth is the clearer issue: saved Maya, Priya and Noah accounts have bought every current node in their respective 12-node modern career sets while retaining hundreds of career points. Some other sampled wallets have no currently learnable node despite a large balance. More job titles alone would not solve that.','', 'Ordinary battles remain accessible under this moderate, two-day-per-week Adventure policy. More demanding matchups, Elite-hunt choices, player-specific tactics and long-form world narrative need separate evaluation. These results do not justify weakening companion-led builds or restoring HP/MP after every encounter.','', '[Prioritized evidence](PRIORITIES.md) · [Mechanics reproductions](mechanics-probes.json) · [All raw results and source hashes](results.json) · [Daily records](daily-progress.csv) · [Standalone cohort figure](cohort.svg) · [Standalone journey figure](journeys.svg)','', 'The APK and app rules remain version 1.25.0. This study changes no balances or live user data.']
